{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "generated", "elements": [{"id": "v25RyEQ94L6AD01YKdGV", "type": "frame", "x": 390, "y": 20, "width": 2210, "height": 1700, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#bbbbbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0095", "roundness": null, "seed": 2032115569, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 924658148, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790890881340, "created": 1790890881340, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "System diagram"}, {"id": "qQQ0lojnTiGnsAZLarj2", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 40, "width": 328.90000000000003, "height": 113.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 1127215641, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1937313276, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790890881340, "created": 1790890881340, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "REQUIREMENTS (ask 5, then move)\nWho gets the alert, and on which channels?\nRules per device, or global across the fleet?\nWhat if a device comes back after an hour:\n  drain the backlog, and do old samples alert?\nHow fresh: seconds, or a minute?\nScale: devices, numbers per sample, rate?", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "REQUIREMENTS (ask 5, then move)\nWho gets the alert, and on which channels?\nRules per device, or global across the fleet?\nWhat if a device comes back after an hour:\n  drain the backlog, and do old samples alert?\nHow fresh: seconds, or a minute?\nScale: devices, numbers per sample, rate?", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "U6Xp0EUIAwAthYX9QIUi", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 187.75, "width": 314.6, "height": 130.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0002", "roundness": null, "seed": 1904388305, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 758636162, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790890881340, "created": 1790890881340, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A USER CAN\nCreate, edit, delete an alert rule:\n  over / under a limit, or\n  changed by more than X within Y seconds.\nChoose where it goes: SMS, Slack, email.\nReceive the alert; see open alerts; ack one.\n(A device sends 128 numbers every second.\n It is pre-configured: a black box.)", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "A USER CAN\nCreate, edit, delete an alert rule:\n  over / under a limit, or\n  changed by more than X within Y seconds.\nChoose where it goes: SMS, Slack, email.\nReceive the alert; see open alerts; ack one.\n(A device sends 128 numbers every second.\n It is pre-configured: a black box.)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "slwxqr3JIJ2RiANCaA1n", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 351.75, "width": 328.90000000000003, "height": 130.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0003", "roundness": null, "seed": 2139010698, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1911763732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790890881340, "created": 1790890881340, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "TECHNICAL CHALLENGES\nSpotty links: batches arrive late, twice,\n  or out of order. Up to 6 h of backlog.\nEvaluate on EVENT time, not arrival time.\nRate-of-change needs per-device order + state.\nOne slow channel must not block the others.\nNo alert storms; no repeat at 2 a.m. (UTC!)\nAvailability over consistency.", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "TECHNICAL CHALLENGES\nSpotty links: batches arrive late, twice,\n  or out of order. Up to 6 h of backlog.\nEvaluate on EVENT time, not arrival time.\nRate-of-change needs per-device order + state.\nOne slow channel must not block the others.\nNo alert storms; no repeat at 2 a.m. (UTC!)\nAvailability over consistency.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "Njz12Xm0xSi8LSnMKKwT", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 515.75, "width": 328.90000000000003, "height": 146.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0004", "roundness": null, "seed": 1466017895, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 782332723, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790890881340, "created": 1790890881340, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CORE ENTITIES\nDevice(id, last_seen, acked_seq)\nSample(device_id, seq, event_ts, v[128])\nAlertRule(id, metric_idx, op over|under|delta,\n  threshold, window_s, severity, version)\nSubscription(rule_id, channel, target)\nAlert(id, rule_id, device_id, event_ts, value,\n  state firing|resolved, late)\nNotification(alert_id, channel, status, tries)", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CORE ENTITIES\nDevice(id, last_seen, acked_seq)\nSample(device_id, seq, event_ts, v[128])\nAlertRule(id, metric_idx, op over|under|delta,\n  threshold, window_s, severity, version)\nSubscription(rule_id, channel, target)\nAlert(id, rule_id, device_id, event_ts, value,\n  state firing|resolved, late)\nNotification(alert_id, channel, status, tries)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "skQgneNIHcBvfa9hsqLe", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 696.0, "width": 336.05, "height": 130.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0005", "roundness": null, "seed": 2018164412, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1574954821, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790890881340, "created": 1790890881340, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "API\nDevice: POST /devices/{id}/samples\n  {samples:[{seq, ts, v[128]}]}\n  -> 200 {acked_through: seq} | 429 retry_after\nUser:  POST|GET|PUT|DELETE /rules\n  POST /rules/{id}/subscriptions\n  GET /alerts?state=firing\n  POST /alerts/{id}/ack", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "API\nDevice: POST /devices/{id}/samples\n  {samples:[{seq, ts, v[128]}]}\n  -> 200 {acked_through: seq} | 429 retry_after\nUser:  POST|GET|PUT|DELETE /rules\n  POST /rules/{id}/subscriptions\n  GET /alerts?state=firing\n  POST /alerts/{id}/ack", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "0ctjIHZnmXxSjjAZnAoV", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 860.0, "width": 321.75, "height": 113.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0006", "roundness": null, "seed": 1234175689, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1837766729, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790890881340, "created": 1790890881340, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "WHAT BREAKS FIRST\nA device returns with 6 h queued: 21,600\nsamples, 22 MB. Drain oldest-first in\nacked batches, capped per device.\nOld samples evaluate, but the alert says\nLATE (data from 05:10 UTC).\nSlack is down: only the Slack queue backs up.", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "WHAT BREAKS FIRST\nA device returns with 6 h queued: 21,600\nsamples, 22 MB. Drain oldest-first in\nacked batches, capped per device.\nOld samples evaluate, but the alert says\nLATE (data from 05:10 UTC).\nSlack is down: only the Slack queue backs up.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "mvcyfVLaVlDIurAi1gZn", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 60, "width": 260, "height": 100, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0007", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1302892425, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1667921380, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "svgEKKAvs7dk3T334Qf5"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "nbftFJ34OLG9oFawjCvi"}], "updated": 1790890881340, "created": 1790890881340, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "svgEKKAvs7dk3T334Qf5", "type": "text", "x": 430, "y": 81.875, "width": 240, "height": 56.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0008", "roundness": null, "seed": 302224988, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1481646756, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790890881340, "created": 1790890881340, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "10,000 devices\nbuffer 6 h on disk\nsend in seq order", "fontSize": 15, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "mvcyfVLaVlDIurAi1gZn", "originalText": "10,000 devices\nbuffer 6 h on disk\nsend in seq order", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "qYcoZoWVmydHdM6VwyjH", "type": "rectangle", "x": 900, "